{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:30 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"孫儷攜子女撐鄧超場  15歲大仔等等近照曝光 遺傳媽媽精緻側臉  擁6呎男模身高\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c3fd0180907e5bda9ce744a7d0b9af7/2026-11/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_99.png\"/>\n<p>娛樂圈模範夫妻鄧超與孫儷近日再次成為焦點。內地實力派「大滿貫視后」孫儷日前攜同一對子女現身，支持老公鄧超的演出。有網民在社交平台分享現場影片，片中孫儷 15 歲的大仔「等等」鄧涵之因清秀外貌與高挑身形，迅速在網絡上引發熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>孫儷大仔等等近照曝光</h2>\n<p>當天孫儷帶著兒子「等等」及女兒「小花」站在觀眾席。年僅 15 歲的「等等」身穿黑色連帽衛衣搭配灰色運動褲，打扮隨性得體。令人注目的是，他的身高已明顯超越身旁的媽媽，目測超過 180 厘米，身形比例優越。影片中的「等等」側臉輪廓分明、五官精緻，面對鏡頭表現得落落大方，網民紛紛盛讚他完美繼承了媽媽的優良基因，極具男模氣質。</p>\n<img alt=\"孫儷與老公鄧超於2010年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daf2020cb532c6e44f83831fef108824/2025-05/001Pza0mgy1i1212gzz5yj60u00u00xy02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷曾被傳舉家移民英國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f10703f1b452ed7a9e62da3e9a0fcf7/2025-05/001Pza0mgy1i1212dqy7uj60u00u0dkl02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超和孫儷婚後非常恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6463517a940b933aad30035e365fb1ab/2024-05/20210610114424-12d146a2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超與孫儷育有一子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e32298ea66154e874b54d5e1e15798eb/2024-05/14_212.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超與孫儷育曾對仔女好保護。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f0e25981a98959a9cdabdd6f4361687/2024-05/fztqr9-qnuxuspotau70q34biijphhxdvlodd1s6hxc.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超和孫儷曾帶子女現身首映。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5390ef5d1ee63be284bdce44f42c671d/2024-05/171491057487333_p19942393.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷近日被見到帶仔女睇騷支持老公鄧超。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb42b57ea2ab5366999dc55e9f876322/2026-11/suen_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷的大仔已高過媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87e841704911f0cdd63f36982e64b8e6/2026-11/suen_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e5d7b90c44019ab834545a180504f3a/2026-11/suen_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷的大仔「等等」低頭玩手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/646f02e394f8dd8a9bb4c1003e6a3111/2026-11/suen_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷與仔女不時交流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/634db71a5820edfdc46cb3e01ed14399/2026-11/suen_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷的大仔身高目測超過180cm。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fb4e16a665eae800566d54d735573a2/2026-11/suen_40_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷的女兒遺傳父母的高顏值。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08998315d949bdfd2ea8d5c992ac260/2026-11/suen_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超在台上放閃「我的愛也在現場」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb832d5e04f024a13cc88e1ce6f86ce6/2026-11/suen_60_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷14歲的兒子「等等」，身高已有180cm。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3c707de95cd99eea526a39beddb8890/2026-04/VS------0_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷兒子「等等」是籃球健將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b5fb86b9ae12441047fa2da98952e25/2026-04/VS------0_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「等等」曾在U14男子籃球賽中榮獲亞軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b4b95040b9022c8330a67c9095678d8/2026-04/VS------0_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指「等等」跟孫儷成個餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b7f81afbed418471acdfe80686a64ab/2026-04/VS------0_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷曾在社交平台分享在London Bridge拍攝的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2cdc7d7256c15222b80e6d45f990b69f/2025-06/001Pza0mgy1i176ts2hpsj623w35s1kz02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷對比自己13歲時在London Bridge拍攝的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2499e16166822a439b01b29489163d30/2025-06/001Pza0mgy1i176tmw537j61is1w0dwn02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷一家身處英國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fac5e69c08198d928e19259ab1cbcf7c/2025-06/001Pza0mgy1i1gguw6tvoj618z0u0anj02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指孫儷的子女已在當地就讀頂尖學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/499f26067208cce0f3e4b98b932d1d30/2025-06/001Pza0mgy1i1gguv0m22j618z0u0alm02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷發文表示想跟老公鄧超在上海終老。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb4cd6ca0c8a3131758b0eca5a4409e1/2025-06/001Pza0mgy1i1gguvmq01j61400u0wxl02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷細女在香港出生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c325636de178caf3509c6c26abe6faf/2025-05/001Pza0mgy1i1212e9t2tj60u00u07a602_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷女兒「小花」，繼承了媽媽的舞蹈天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23770b4c01792b2074351885610f81dd/2025-05/001Pza0mgy1hvpa7nbpw1j664w43c1l002_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷不時陪女兒去比賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81d0a5cc08b9de4c68dc7fb766a1a9f0/2025-05/001Pza0mgy1hvpa7tkl7vj635s23w1kz02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷女兒小花舞技高超。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6376951a56e2fb254c616d4c8ce1bf86/2025-05/a2_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷女兒小花成為比賽亮點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89701070ce619e9ae18c8613b221b812/2025-05/A11_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷女兒小花奪得比賽冠軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf561f06a0e604b92ae2d3b1861b4ad7/2025-05/a10_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷和鄧超出席支持，更化身女兒的粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43133d65601da036e4db9434bd0979d8/2025-05/c1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷和鄧超在場邊被粉絲認出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/053712825a626a4d756899ff64c1f0fc/2025-05/c5_1.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鄧超孫儷是公認模範夫妻</h2>\n<p>台上的鄧超亦不忘公開放閃，幸福地表示「我的愛人、孫儷老師也在現場」，展現家庭溫馨一面。孫儷與鄧超自 2010 年結婚以來，至今已攜手走過 16 年，感情依舊甜蜜，是圈中公認的「模範夫妻」。</p>\n<img alt=\"孫儷是胡慧中的姨甥孫女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae7e1c700765f702c348a001d163483a/2024-05/005westnly1hkq0248ov4j32tl3y84qt.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷是視后給人馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de9f894367e46da9f2a5858746b7dc47/2024-05/005westnly1hin28vwew5j32jf3k01l0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷入行逾20年獲獎無數。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de06ae460aabd975a4fc4712b61608ca/2024-05/005westnly1hin28dp43bj32um3zne83.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷是內地電視史上最年輕完成大滿貫獎項的女演員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07ad463a169181fe5e2307a10074278a/2024-05/001pza0mgy1hldyc43l3yj62kl2klb2a02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷透過優秀人才入境計劃領取香港身分證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0343bcab6263cb7d483c9e66a54a5412/2024-05/sunligaoshouxu3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"內地視后孫儷拍過很多古裝片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55431f01aac10dca2d731b6ea08be541/2023-03/01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"內地女星孫儷憑劇集《甄嬛傳》，紅遍中港台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ff60186ffbf9a419c926304d08cb160/2026-04/wne24p21091112.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫儷與鄧超曾夫妻檔拍電影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d79918713f1251c99128fb0d6dbc3a4b/2024-05/3fb95477feef607b.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超與孫儷在2010年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82a85d8665f9931edc2866b76064e587/2024-05/2-40-600x418.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超與愛妻孫儷曾一同入圍金馬獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e9d30cad2575a4ebbc9fa2f5d5d93dd/2024-05/yiyingshuangshuangruweizuijianannuzhujiaodezuodengchaoyuyousunlifufugongtongchuxiruweizhejiuhui.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超2014年起至2018年五年間參與綜藝《奔跑吧兄弟》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f3faa4844b65623765eb3b73892f204/2024-05/t011e43487db55cad23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超是內地金雞影帝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ba551c85b79b41afc98d3a80837f954/2024-05/00615l7gly1hjj9bxitowj33674fv7wn.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超是多個綜藝節目的台柱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1030aeed2aba06873d5d4e62e0013933/2024-05/00615l7gly1hpehp7wy8tj32tc480npi.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超近年參與不少綜藝節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/517544a0449c29b9d2e624f6e57c62d8/2024-05/00615l7gly1hpehpstivvj32tc4804qu.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超身家豐厚，是娛樂公司老闆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de8a2199b088b66b976d1e9736cb8eee/2024-05/00615l7gly1hpdd42034aj347s6bk1l6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧超要有型是都可以好chok。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e06eeb2e3e0a5593d1ed57e7836fb67/2024-05/00615l7gly1hjj9e1fmjsj348q2ttu12.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T14:06:07.214966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:20.058274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:59:35.689686+00:00","content_hash":"ee327d4c61a7bdef5a3638d98456c1f86b8d60b3c22fe8e108c19c0e081441b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}